  "$comment": "Shared test vectors for the Guard detectors and the host matcher. The TS reference (tests/integration/guard-contract/detection-vectors.test.ts), the Go agent (tests/integration/agent-go/detectors.test.ts) and the Rust agent (guard/agent/tests/vectors.rs) all load this file; a disagreement is a bug in the agent. Every identifier here is a PUBLISHED or synthetic test value: the ATO's example ABN, ASIC's example ACNs, the Visa/Stripe test cards, AWS's documented example key id; the TFNs and Medicare numbers are checksum-valid synthetic values. Nothing here is a real credential (gitleaks.toml allowlists this path by name).",
